<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_III__cl_11__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A citizen may only receive a foreign award from a Head of State in the First Schedule."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
