<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A citizen shall not receive an unrecognized foreign award from any person whether within or outside Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_III__cl_12__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_III__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
