<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A person shall not use and enjoy the appellation and style of any Yang di-Pertuan Agong award in any form and manner if he is not entitled to use and enjoy such appellation and style under the statutes instituting the award."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
