<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "A, is a holder of a Yang di-Pertuan Agong award who is married to Z. Z is entitled to use and enjoy the appellation and style of such award during her marriage to A. A and Z are now divorced and Z continues to use and enjoy the appellation and style of such award. Z commits an offence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/24/eng@> .
